      "source": "Factory to create a <a href=\"DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> based on the configuration of the provided components. Specifically,\nthis factory creates a <code>SingleQueryFallbackDataAccessStrategy</code> that falls back to\n<a href=\"DefaultDataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DefaultDataAccessStrategy</code></a> if Single Query Loading is not supported. This factory encapsulates\n<a href=\"DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> for consistent access strategy creation.",
      "translation": "工厂会根据提供的组件配置，创建一个基于 <a href=\"DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> 的实例。具体而言，该工厂会创建一个 <code>SingleQueryFallbackDataAccessStrategy</code>；如果单查询加载功能不受支持，则该策略将回退到 <a href=\"DefaultDataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>DefaultDataAccessStrategy</code></a>。此工厂封装了 <a href=\"DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>，以实现一致的数据访问策略创建。",
      "count": 1
    },
